 in the waystone. Its lock plate bears a worn stamp: a seven-spoked wheel with a closed eye at its centre. A coaching inn faces the square."}},"result":{"ok":true,"check":null,"value":{"id":"f731e035-b7d9-5180-b209-cf2b8773c6ca","name":"Wayside square"},"player":null,"summary":"Wayside square updated"},"position":1},{"id":"731400db-c978-5e41-b06c-7a13345b1279","call":{"id":"toolu_014z1Sn9UKERh8z68tiniEVi","name":"note_world","arguments":{"key":"board-chest","kind":"fact","value":"I placed the board's strongbox in the corner because the player asked for a chest. It belongs to the work organiser and holds the job ledger, a purse of 14 sp of posted wages, and a brass waymark disc with the same seven-spoked wheel and closed eye. The disc is an old road-warden token and turns faintly toward the nearest true waystone. The lock is a fine old one (hard to pick with crude tools). The oak body is older than the iron bands; someone reused a road-wardens' chest. Opening it at night is theft from the organiser, who posts the wages from it in the morning.","operation":"set"}},"result":{"ok":true,"check":null,"value":{"key":"board-chest","kind":"fact","since":0},"player":null,"summary":"DM note updated"},"position":2},{"id":"db068f15-abcd-5b9d-9375-5d935d13c4a3","call":{"id":"toolu_011DUyVv1thQanqhrazBaJJo","name":"note_world","arguments":{"key":"plan_inn-watcher","kind":"fact","value":"Someone awake in the coaching inn, maybe the innkeeper or the organiser lodging there, may look out at noise near the chest. If Rowan lingers at the lock, a door opens and a lantern comes out.","warning":"The lamplight in the inn window flickers as someone moves past it.","actorRef":"world","operation":"set","planStatus":"open","consequence":"A lantern-bearer from the inn crosses the square and finds Rowan at the chest.","dueInMinutes":15}},"result":{"ok":true,"check":null,"value":{"key":"plan_inn-watcher","kind":"fact","plan":{"actor":null,"status":"open","dueWorldMinutes":15}},"player":null,"summary":"DM plan updated"},"position":3},{"id":"1998c2f5-ad18-500c-8537-1f5803a46b25","call":{"id":"toolu_01VumVWDgqzNuwsvx2ALsVM7","name":"finish_turn","arguments":{"spotlight":["123afc17-5d76-5642-ab31-04bf7590c184"],"sceneKinds":["exploration","mystery"],"nextTension":"tense","playerMoment":false}},"result":{"ok":true,"check":null,"value":{"recorded":true,"playerMoment":false},"player":null,"summary":"Turn recorded"},"position":4},{"id":"54f42279-6560-5a8b-bb3d-e193a9394b60","call":{"id":"toolu_01CVNYjWjQvMef1vzjQCgSPp","name":"finish_turn","arguments":{"spotlight":["123afc17-5d76-5642-ab31-04bf7590c184"],"sceneKinds":["exploration"],"nextTension":"tense","playerMoment":false}},"result":{"ok":true,"check":null,"value":{"recorded":true,"playerMoment":false},"player":null,"summary":"Turn recorded"},"position":5}],"partyNames":["Rowan"],"party":[{"hp":null,"maxHp":null}],"diagnostics":[{"kind":"depth","effort":"high","reason":"no tension signal; the base of the range (deep only for «важный ход» or a combat climax)","tension":"calm"},{"kind":"rolls_checked","error":null,"rolls":0,"untold":0,"costUsd":0.000121,"undeclared":1}],"meta":{"threads":[],"ownerRule":null,"spotlight":["123afc17-5d76-5642-ab31-04bf7590c184"],"npcRefused":false,"sceneKinds":["exploration"],"nextTension":"tense","playerLikes":null,"playerMoment":false,"playerMomentReason":null},"pin":{"depth":{"max":"high","min":"high","reason":"no tension signal; the base of the range (deep only for «важный ход» or a combat climax)","streak":0,"boosted":false,"tension":"calm"},"effort":"high","limits":{"itemsPerTurn":50,"moneyPerTurn":1000000,"minutesPerTurn":10080,"toolCallsPerTurn":40,"charactersPerTurn":20,"modelRequestsPerTurn":10},"modelId":"claude-opus-5-5","privacy":"single-narrator","runtime":"dm-loop-v1","providerId":"anthropic"},"http":[{"event":"http","status":200,"requestBytes":79998,"latencyMs":1486,"provider":"openrouter","endpointHost":"openrouter.ai","requestId":"gen-1792915585-4NaSnmj5LKy9YjXeJsmK","servedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","upstream":"Claude Platform on AWS","messageId":"msg_011CgNcPWYccyhBWimVGxE3m","servedModelMatches":true},{"event":"http","status":200,"requestBytes":91929,"latencyMs":1616,"provider":"openrouter","endpointHost":"openrouter.ai","requestId":"gen-1792915622-g0pakUtDmCAhwDhNogez","servedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","upstream":"Claude Platform on AWS","messageId":"msg_011CgNcSGdHghyLrMoND1mo5","servedModelMatches":true}],"scriptProblems":[],"battlefieldInContext":false,"narration":"The wayside square is empty at this hour. The notice board stands dark under its little shingled roof, its papers stirring in the night wind. Across the cobbles, a single shuttered window of the coaching inn leaks a thin line of lamplight. Nobody is about.\n\nThe chest sits in the corner where the board's lean-to meets the old waystone. It's a squat thing of black oak gone grey with weather, and a chain as thick as your thumb runs from its handle to an iron ring set in the stone. You kneel beside it. The cobbles are cold through your trousers.\n\nUp close, it's older than it first looked. The iron bands are newer work, hammered on later by a cruder smith. Under them, the lock plate has a sign stamped into it: a wheel with seven spokes, with an eye drawn shut at its centre. Hundreds of hands have worn it almost smooth. The keyhole is small and set deep. It's not a farmhouse lock. Somewhere inside, when the wind leans on the lid, something shifts with a soft metal sound.\n\nBehind you, the line of light in the inn window flickers, as if someone just walked past the lamp.\n\n---\n\n*Out of game: your records show only a compass on Rowan, with no knife. Does Rowan have something else to work the lock with, or do you want to try another way?*","checks":[{"label":"outcome \"committed\"","kind":"outcome","pass":true,"detail":"outcome committed"}],"changes":{"npcs":[],"places":[],"items":{"added":[],"changed":[]},"quests":{"added":[],"changed":[]},"money":{},"worldMinute